'''Aaron's Archery Appendages''' is a shop where [[Armour salesman|Aaron the Armour salesman]] sells low level [[ranged armour]]. Aaron also sells the Ranged [[Cape of Accomplishment]]. His shop is located in the [[Ranging Guild]], so it can only be accessed by players with at least level 40 [[Ranged]].

